id=one_force
name=One Force
version=V3
versionCode=3
author=Mini_Voidyy
description=One UI version spoofer with a blue theme. Forces Galaxy Store to serve app updates by spoofing One UI / Android build props (incl. security patch) at boot. Supports One UI 6.0 and above. Compatible with Magisk, KernelSU, KernelSU Next, SukiSU and APatch. Toggle ON/OFF, change target versions, revert app updates or install APKs from the WebUI, Action button, or terminal menu.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MiniVoidyy/OneForce-/main/update.json
